{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854060/extras/06770bd069a4dc9e58811c0dc1a59701.avif?t=1768784895\" width=800 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >get to the top of the pinball machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left button for the left flipper, right for the right. Pull the plunger (that metal thing that launches the ball from the start). That\u2019s it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expecting more from a pinball machine?<br><br><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the ball\u2019s momentum and time your flipper hits just right. Use the environment to your advantage and discover your own shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Warning: Sometimes a clever idea can backfire.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied levels, each with its own personality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new stage brings fresh challenges\u2014ride the wind, hit buttons, travel through gravity tunnels, smash meteors, and conquer arenas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A true paradise for speedrunners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Before making any rash decisions, remember: the beginning is always a place you can return to.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive visual style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine clearly shows its age-chipped paint reveals once-hidden screws, and loose wires occasionally peek through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, none of that takes away from the handcrafted charm and craftsmanship FlippTech once poured into their machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(FlippTech is not responsible for any damage to your mental well-being, nor for any destruction caused while attempting to complete this product. Play responsibly.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prototype Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/12b4faa54e34718d680191666fade25e4211f858.jpg"},{"name":"FlippTech Ball ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/20687fe0074524f0bad70c74f406856a72072732.jpg"},{"name":"Copper Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/f0e64f93431658cc7a1626fe4c633e44b2188f61.jpg"},{"name":"Drone Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/b995d9c1e20a61a5d43276e18e425f10282ace25.jpg"},{"name":"Star Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/a3ff2013f5195ce199630c377e598b695ac69571.jpg"},{"name":"Lightning Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/3fd7d03ed3064f975fa97d9c285160f4cf65dabc.jpg"},{"name":"Fireball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/926a83e9e6c55e8c0771d3c9292af00bd158bf1c.jpg"},{"name":"Oil Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/255216776b3068e2167885776040489402dbd7d1.jpg"},{"name":"Gravity Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854060/aff67ee17a9835455c7150ce32fbb0f1f891dd2f.jpg"},{"name